   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating that portion of New York state route 7 which constitutes the causeway over the Tomhannock Reservoir in the town of Pittstown in Rensselaer county, state of New York as the \"Brigadier General James Kennedy Memorial Highway\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S7032",
